OL,3,GNEWSAThree men arrested over Edinburgh
OL,4,Apub shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection with a shooting at a pub in
OL,8,FEdinburgh.
OL,10,FOne person was injured when shots were
OL,11,Ffired towards the window of the Robin's
OL,12,FNest on Gilmerton Road on Friday 23
OL,13,FOctober.
OL,15,FPolice said officers had carried out
OL,16,Fextensive inquiries and executed
OL,17,Fwarrants at a number of addresses in
OL,18,FLarkhall, South Lanarkshire.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
