OL,3,GNEWSAThree men arrested over Edinburgh
OL,4,Apub shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men, aged 26 and 30, have been
OL,7,Fcharged in connection with discharge of
OL,8,Fa firearm, and are due to appear at
OL,9,FEdinburgh Sheriff Court on Thursday. A
OL,10,Fthird man, aged 41, was also arrested
OL,11,Fbut was released pending further
OL,12,Finquiries.
